.Dd $Mdocdate: August 11 2026 $
.Dt XAI-STATUS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm xai-status
.Nd dump xAI / Grok Build account status as sysctl-style key/value lines
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm xai-status.pl
.Op Fl jlr
.Op Fl a Ar path
.Op Fl b Ar url
.Op Fl s Ar section
.Op Fl t Ar secs
.Op Fl -refresh
.Op Fl -no-refresh
.Op Fl -refresh-only
.Op Fl -json
.Op Fl -list
.Op Fl -help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
queries the same
.Sy cli-chat-proxy
HTTP endpoints that Grok Build uses to display coding-credit usage, prepaid
balance, subscription tier, remote settings, and related account status.
Output is one
.Cm key=value
line per field
.Pq sysctl-like ,
suitable for
.Xr grep 1 ,
.Xr awk 1 ,
or machine consumption.
.Pp
Credentials are read from
.Pa ~/.grok/auth.json
.Pq the same file written by Ic grok login .
The script can refresh an OIDC session independently of a running Grok
process: it performs the standard refresh-token grant against
.Lk https://auth.x.ai ,
takes an advisory lock on
.Pa auth.json.lock ,
and writes the new access and refresh tokens back to
.Pa auth.json
so every Grok or
.Nm
instance sharing that home directory can adopt them.
.Pp
Timestamps in the dump are converted to the system local timezone with
the Perl
.Sy Date::Manip
module
and printed as:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
YYYYMMDD HHMMSS.<ms> ±HH:MM
.Ed
.Pp
For example
.Dl 20260810 204254.415 -05:00
.Pp
Each timestamp key also emits:
.Bl -tag -width Ds -offset indent
.It Va key.raw
Original RFC 3339 string from the API or auth store.
.It Va key.unix
Unix epoch seconds
.Pq UTC .
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl s Ar section , Fl -section Ar section
Limit output to one section.
May be repeated.
Default is all sections.
Valid names:
.Cm auth ,
.Cm user ,
.Cm subscription ,
.Cm credits ,
.Cm legacy ,
.Cm autotopup ,
.Cm settings ,
.Cm models .
The alias
.Cm billing
expands to
.Cm credits
plus
.Cm legacy .
.It Fl r , Fl -refresh
Force an OIDC token refresh before fetching status
.Pq always rewrites auth.json on success .
.It Fl -no-refresh
Never call the IdP and never rewrite
.Pa auth.json .
Use a still-valid access token only.
.It Fl -refresh-only
Refresh
.Pq or adopt a sibling token already on disk ,
print refresh-related keys, and exit without billing/status GETs.
.It Fl j , Fl -json
Also emit a compact JSON blob per section as
.Va prefix.json .
.It Fl a Ar path , Fl -auth Ar path
Path to
.Pa auth.json
.Pq default: Pa ~/.grok/auth.json
or
.Ev GROK_HOME Ns /auth.json .
.It Fl b Ar url , Fl -base Ar url
cli-chat-proxy base URL
.Pq default: Li https://cli-chat-proxy.grok.com/v1 .
.It Fl t Ar secs , Fl -timeout Ar secs
HTTP timeout in seconds
.Pq default: 20 .
.It Fl l , Fl -list
List section names and exit.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Print a short usage summary and exit.
.El
.Sh SECTIONS
.Bl -tag -width subscriptionXX
.It Cm auth
Local credential metadata from
.Pa auth.json
.Pq no secrets printed :
scope, mode, user id, email, principal, issuer, expiry, proxy base.
Also emits
.Va xai.date.format
and
.Va xai.date.local_tz .
.It Cm user
.Li GET /v1/user
— profile, principal, team/org, block reasons,
.Va hasGrokCodeAccess .
.It Cm subscription
.Li GET /v1/user?include=subscription
— same as
.Cm user
plus live
.Va subscriptionTier .
.It Cm credits
.Li GET /v1/billing?format=credits
— preferred credits shape used by Grok's
.Li /usage
UI:
usage percent, weekly/monthly period, prepaid balance, on-demand caps,
per-product usage
.Pq GrokBuild / GrokChat ,
unified-billing flag.
.It Cm legacy
.Li GET /v1/billing
— older monthly-limit / used / history shape.
.It Cm autotopup
.Li GET /v1/auto-topup-rule
— auto top-up enablement and dollar amounts
.Pq cents; often negative ledger sign; absolute USD also printed .
.It Cm settings
.Li GET /v1/settings
— remote feature flags, access gate, display tier, announcements, …
.It Cm models
.Li GET /v1/models
— model catalog available to this credential.
.It Cm history
Composite historical intel
.Pq not included in the default section list :
server monthly dollar history from
.Li GET /billing ,
current credits snapshot,
a full change timeline of prepaid balance and usage percent reconstructed from
.Pa ~/.grok/logs/unified.jsonl
billing polls
.Pq day and hour buckets, fast-burn windows ,
and a catalog of local sessions from
.Pa ~/.grok/sessions
.Pq summary + signals: turns, models, context-window tokens by day .
Still
.Em not
a server tokens-per-day ledger.
.El
.Sh OUTPUT
Lines look like:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
xai.credits.credit_usage_percent=13
xai.credits.credit_remaining_percent=87
xai.credits.period.end=20260817 204254.415 -05:00
xai.credits.period.end.raw=2026-08-18T01:42:54.415546+00:00
xai.credits.prepaid_balance_usd=0.00
xai.subscription.subscription_tier=XPremiumPlus
.Ed
.Pp
High-signal prefixes:
.Bl -tag -width xai.billing_legacyXX -offset indent
.It Va xai.auth.*
Local session / refresh state.
.It Va xai.credits.*
Weekly
.Pq or monthly
allowance usage and prepaid dollars
.Pq what the Grok credit bar shows .
.It Va xai.billing_legacy.*
Legacy monthly dollar tracker.
.It Va xai.autotopup.*
Auto top-up rule.
.It Va xai.subscription.*
Live subscription tier from the backend.
.It Va xai.settings.*
Remote settings / access gate / display tier.
.It Va xai.models.*
Available models.
.El
.Pp
Money fields from the API are integer
.Em cents
.Pq often as JSON Li {"val":N} .
The script emits both
.Va *_cents
and
.Va *_usd .
Prepaid and top-up amounts may be stored as
.Em negative
cents on the wire; USD display uses the absolute value unless noted as signed
remaining.
.Sh TOKEN REFRESH
When the access token is missing
.Va expires_at ,
hard-expired, or within five minutes of expiry
.Pq same early-invalidation buffer as Grok Build ,
.Nm
refreshes automatically unless
.Fl -no-refresh
is set.
.Pp
Refresh algorithm
.Pq matches Grok Build Ic AuthManager::refresh_chain :
.Bl -enum
.It
Open and
.Xr flock 2
.Pa auth.json.lock
exclusively.
.It
Re-read
.Pa auth.json .
If a sibling process already wrote a still-valid access token, adopt it
and skip the IdP.
.It
.Li GET {issuer}/.well-known/openid-configuration
.It
.Li POST {token_endpoint}
with
.Li grant_type=refresh_token ,
.Li refresh_token ,
.Li client_id ,
and optional
.Li principal_type
/
.Li principal_id .
.It
Write the new
.Va key
.Pq access token ,
.Va expires_at ,
and rotated
.Va refresh_token
.Pq if the IdP returned one
back into
.Pa auth.json
under the same lock
.Pq atomic temp + rename, mode 0600 .
.El
.Pp
Bearer and refresh token values are
.Em never
printed; only presence flags and expiry metadata are emitted.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width GROK_PRODUCTION_CLI_CHAT_PROXY_BASE_URL
.It Ev GROK_HOME
Root directory for config
.Pq default: Pa ~/.grok .
.It Ev GROK_AUTH_PATH , Ev XAI_STATUS_AUTH
Override path to
.Pa auth.json .
.It Ev GROK_CLI_CHAT_PROXY_BASE_URL , Ev GROK_PRODUCTION_CLI_CHAT_PROXY_BASE_URL
Override proxy base URL.
.It Ev TZ
Timezone name used when converting timestamps
.Pq also discovered from Pa /etc/localtime
symlink when unset .
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width ~/.grok/auth.json.lockXX
.It Pa ~/.grok/auth.json
OIDC session and optional API-key store
.Pq mode 0600 .
.It Pa ~/.grok/auth.json.lock
Advisory lock coordinating multi-process refresh.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Pp
.Fl -refresh-only
exits
.Dv 0
on successful refresh or sibling adoption, non-zero on failure.
.Sh EXAMPLES
Show remaining weekly allowance and prepaid dollars:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
xai-status.pl -s credits | egrep 'usage|remaining|prepaid|period\\.(start|end)='
.Ed
.Pp
Dump every historical scrap this host can assemble:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
xai-status.pl --no-refresh -s history > /tmp/xai-history.txt
egrep 'monthly|prepaid\\.(max|burn|spent)|by_day|fast_burns|sessions\\.by_day' \\
  /tmp/xai-history.txt
.Ed
.Pp
Force session renewal without waiting for Grok:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
xai-status.pl --refresh-only
.Ed
.Pp
Subscription tier plus credits:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
xai-status.pl -s subscription -s credits \e
  | egrep 'tier|usage_percent|prepaid|period.end='
.Ed
.Pp
Read the formal HTTP/OIDC API reference used by this tool:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
less scripts/xai-status-api.md
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Lk https://cli-chat-proxy.grok.com/v1
.Pq production proxy base ,
.Pa scripts/xai-status-api.md
.Pq formal API specification for implementers ,
Grok Build sources under
.Pa crates/codegen/xai-grok-shell/src/extensions/billing.rs
and
.Pa crates/codegen/xai-grok-shell/src/auth/oidc/ .
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Grok Build tooling .
.Sh CAVEATS
.Bl -bullet
.It
Copying the same refresh token to two machines and refreshing concurrently
can yield
.Li invalid_grant
.Pq IdP rotation reuse detection .
Prefer one login per machine, or serialize refresh against a shared
.Pa auth.json .
.It
.Dq Tokens left
in the UI is a
.Em percent of the period allowance ,
not a raw remaining-token counter.
Extra purchased dollars appear as
.Va prepaid_balance_* .
.It
Requires
.Xr perl 1
with
.Sy JSON::PP ,
.Sy LWP::UserAgent ,
.Sy URI::Escape ,
and
.Sy Date::Manip .
.El
